   "sourceHash": "a8ad207918cbd6c9621a862f9307784078e5a51154f9d3118443298cb7f69d12",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]चुनिंदा स्वास्थ्य पैकेजों पर 20% तक की छूट[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
